        "description": "<p>This plugin provides an easy way to download the WordPress database from the admin panel.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>kj-db-downloader</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Navigate to the &#8220;KJ DB Downloader&#8221; page in the WordPress admin area to download your database.</li>\n</ol>\n",
